### 7. 통합 호출 체인

```
app.ts (DOMContentLoaded + requestIdleCallback)
→ AppManager.init()
→ AppEngineRuntime.init()
  ├─ ResponsiveRuntime.getDefault().init()
  ├─ Engine 생성 (aspectRatio 설정)
  ├─ Engine.init()
  │  ├─ renderer.setSize(w, h)
  │  ├─ renderer.setPixelRatio(dpr)
  │  └─ camera.aspect = w/h; updateProjectionMatrix()
  └─ ResizeSetup.init(engine)
    ├─ window.addEventListener("resize", handler)
    ├─ window.visualViewport.addEventListener("resize", handler)  [iOS]
    └─ Debounced handler:
      ├─ ResponsiveRuntime.updateFromWindow()
      │  ├─ Device.updateFromWindow()
      │  ├─ breakpoint 계산
      │  ├─ CSS vars 업데이트
      │  └─ listener들에게 snapshot 배포
      ├─ Engine.applyResponsiveSnapshot(snapshot)
      │  └─ Engine.setViewport(width, height)
      │    ├─ camera.aspect = w/h; updateProjectionMatrix()
      │    ├─ renderer.setSize() / setPixelRatio()
      │    ├─ postProcessor.resize()
      │    └─ backgroundManager.resize()
      └─ scrollDriver.refresh()  [있으면]
```

